{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01050",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 5.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.75,
      "end_seconds": 12.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.83,
      "end_seconds": 16.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.6,
      "end_seconds": 22.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a dry cough in the evenings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.86,
      "end_seconds": 25.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.72,
      "end_seconds": 36.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it began. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.24,
      "end_seconds": 47.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.53,
      "end_seconds": 65.32,
      "duration_seconds": 16.79,
      "text": "It settles a little with antihistamine. Moderate, I'd say. Yes, pollen season. That makes it worse. I'd say once or twice a day. And there's sneezing fits as well, about two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.63,
      "end_seconds": 68.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Ah. Has there been itchy eyes too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.4,
      "end_seconds": 71.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.19,
      "end_seconds": 80.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "So, which medicines do you take at the moment? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.99,
      "end_seconds": 82.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Sumatriptan, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.02,
      "end_seconds": 86.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.72,
      "end_seconds": 89.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "It's 50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.29,
      "end_seconds": 93.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.15,
      "end_seconds": 96.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "About about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.56,
      "end_seconds": 101.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Okay, tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.19,
      "end_seconds": 106.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I have migraines, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.16,
      "end_seconds": 110.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Sure. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.42,
      "end_seconds": 122.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.95,
      "end_seconds": 128.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.98,
      "end_seconds": 138.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Amoxicillin. I come out in... well, a rash all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 142.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "So, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.96,
      "end_seconds": 146.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.68,
      "end_seconds": 150.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.21,
      "end_seconds": 157.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.22,
      "end_seconds": 160.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.59,
      "end_seconds": 167.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.04,
      "end_seconds": 172.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.74,
      "end_seconds": 178.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.39,
      "end_seconds": 194.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, wheeze or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.59,
      "end_seconds": 201.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Let me think, um, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.56,
      "end_seconds": 205.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Sure. Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.26,
      "end_seconds": 209.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "So, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.78,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.51,
      "end_seconds": 218.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.31,
      "end_seconds": 249.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.47,
      "end_seconds": 272.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.4 degrees, respiratory rate 15, heart rate 86, blood pressure 125 over 81, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.07,
      "end_seconds": 278.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.75,
      "end_seconds": 280.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.91,
      "end_seconds": 283.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.02,
      "end_seconds": 295.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.48,
      "end_seconds": 303.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.35,
      "end_seconds": 321.54,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with seasonal hay fever causing the cough at this stage. I can't rule out early asthma yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.74,
      "end_seconds": 327.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.79,
      "end_seconds": 347.88,
      "duration_seconds": 16.09,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like seasonal hay fever causing the cough. For this, fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. That should help with hay fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.2,
      "end_seconds": 354.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Uh, should I carry on if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.55,
      "end_seconds": 370.25,
      "duration_seconds": 14.7,
      "text": "Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Come back in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 371.81,
      "end_seconds": 376.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.21,
      "end_seconds": 382.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.21,
      "end_seconds": 386.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Alright, uh, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}